        <briefdescription>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Updates attributes in a node and recursively updates attributes in subgraphs.</para>
<para>Binding a formal attribute parameter may remove an attribute from a node when the call-site omits that parameter. This requires processing at node scope (not at attribute scope) because attributes may be erased from the node list. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
