    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Binds attribute references in a function body to call-site attribute values.</para>
<para>A bound attribute keeps the original attribute name from the callee function and copies only the value from the corresponding call-site attribute. If the call-site does not supply a value for a referenced attribute, the referenced attribute is removed. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
